    <string>Zenflow uses Bluetooth to connect directly to your Air Band to stream live vitals.</string>
    <key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Zenflow writes your Heart Rate, HRV (SDNN), Resting Heart Rate, SpO2, and Sleep Stages directly to Apple Health for Bevel recovery tracking.</string>
